Begin3
Title:          SJGPlay
Version:        1.29
Entered-Date:   2023-02-19
Description:    Audio CDPlayer with Lyrics
Summary:        Audio CDPlayer with Lyrics. Features syncronized lyrics &
                Karaoke! Easy lyric editor & syncronizer. Saves playlist for
                each CD. Big char display. Many display modes.
                Catalog/sort/print CD's and lyrics. Intro, repeat, button bars,
                waveform scope, freq analyzer, font editor, calendar,
                calculator, and screen saver. Supports SoundBlaster, multiple
                drives, 43/50-line screens, mouse and joystick. Now with SB
                Mixer and improved font support.
Keywords:       cdrom, music, player
Author:         Steve J. Gray
Original-Site:  http://www.6502.org/users/sjgray/software/sjgplay/sjgplay_dos.html
Platforms:      DOS (NASM), FreeDOS
Copying-Policy: Public Domain
Modified-Date:  2025-04-10.1
Changes:        * NLS: English typo corrections and Swedish translation
                update|* removed CI/CD for project|* Metadata updated for
                modified-date and LFN requirements|* improved repository
                INDEX.md
